========================================================================================

CONTEXT:
Our central backend has been successfully isolated into a modular API engine, but the endpoints are currently entirely exposed. We need to implement a comprehensive, industry-standard authentication ring using OAuth2 Password Bearer workflows and JSON Web Tokens (JWT). The system must securely process two distinct access tiers: standard operational users whose records live in our database tables, and a single, highly privileged Super-Admin whose credentials must bypass database lookups entirely.

YOUR OBJECTIVE:
Act as a Principal Security Architect and Cryptography Engineer. Define and write the complete, production-ready security implementation for our FastAPI backend application. 

Do not truncate files or use placeholders. Write the full, execution-ready code blocks while adhering completely to the technical design patterns, logic layers, and architectural boundaries detailed below.

